  "body": "Deadline sale: Closes on Thursday 5 November 2026 at 4:00PM  (unless sold prior)\r\n\r\nPeacefully positioned in one of Castor Bay’s most sought-after locations, this charming weatherboard family home sits proudly on a generous 832m² of freehold land, tucked well back from the road and surrounded by established greenery.\r\n\r\nFrom the moment you arrive, there is an immediate sense of space and privacy. Inside, the home offers a wonderfully versatile layout with three to four bedrooms and two separate living zones, providing flexibility for families, teenagers, guests or those wanting dedicated work-from-home space.\r\n\r\nAt the centre of the home, open-plan living and dining flow naturally outdoors to huge sun-filled decks, creating the perfect setting for relaxed entertaining, morning coffees and long summer evenings with family and friends.\r\n\r\nBeyond the decks, the lush native garden provides a peaceful backdrop and a wonderful connection with nature. There is plenty of room for children and pets to enjoy, while garden lovers will appreciate the established planting and generous outdoor space.\r\n\r\nThe home itself has a warm, welcoming character, with generous proportions and a layout designed for easy family living. Whether you are enjoying quiet time at home or entertaining a crowd, there is room for everyone to spread out and enjoy.\r\n\r\nPosition is another standout. Castor Bay Beach is close by, with Milford and Takapuna offering an excellent selection of cafés, restaurants, shops and amenities, while Auckland’s CBD remains easily accessible. Families will also appreciate the excellent local school zoning.\r\n\r\nOur vendors are committed to their next move, making this a genuine opportunity to secure a substantial freehold property in one of the North Shore’s most tightly held coastal neighbourhoods.\r\n\r\nSpace, privacy, sunshine and a superb Castor Bay setting — this is coastal family living at its best.\r\n\r\nCome and experience it for yourself.",
